swift-im (5.0~alpha2.145.g12d031cf8+dfsg-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Reintroduce Package. (Closes: #1016962)
  * The package will be maintained in the realms of the XMPP Team.
  * d/copyright: review and updated
  * d/control:
    - Remove uneeded version constraints on B-D.
    - Rename library package to match upstream SONAME zero.
    - Point Vcs fields to salsa.
    - Use https for Upstream field.
    - Note that rules won't require root privileges.
    - Update S-V to 4.6.1 -- no changes.
    - Don't package swift-im. (Scons woni't find QT; as this is packaged
      for spectrum2, it is also not needed now.)
  * d/rules:
    - Rework d/rules / d/clean to get rid of scons in the clean target.
    - Enable hardening.
  * Add an customized CI configuration, allowing repotest to fail.

